00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.370
I just had a tooth removed.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:17.320
I had a cracked tooth last week,

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:21.387
and they had to take it,
they had to take it out.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.910
My mom was just calling,
so I just have to,

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.030
well, I'll call her back in a little bit.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.940
But I just had a cracked tooth,

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.050
and they took it out,
and then they screwed in

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.080
I guess a thing that they're going

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.320
to eventually have to put the implant.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.910
So, this entire half of my face is numb,

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.610
