00:27:25.290 --> 00:27:28.160
is to engage on things
that you can engage on

00:27:28.160 --> 00:27:29.850
but are challenging to you

00:27:29.850 --> 00:27:31.890
and are a little bit frustrating to you,

00:27:31.890 --> 00:27:33.310
but when you do it, what you find is

00:27:33.310 --> 00:27:34.550
if you keep you keep engaging on it

00:27:34.550 --> 00:27:37.210
for 20, 30 minutes a
day, 40 minutes a day,

00:27:37.210 --> 00:27:39.280
