you're like, wait, that's not so bad

00:28:26.430 --> 00:28:28.030
now that I have a good foundation,

00:28:28.030 --> 00:28:30.720
now that I'm really building
a habit of learning it.

00:28:30.720 --> 00:28:33.480
So, I think it's all about
having growth mindset,

00:28:33.480 --> 00:28:35.240
